          "focus": [
            { "zh": "即時排程", "en": "Real-time scheduling" },
            { "zh": "車用系統", "en": "Automotive systems" },
            { "zh": "延遲上限證明", "en": "Latency bounds" }
          ],
          "work": {
            "zh": "在車用 SoC 上做多模型共存的排程，證明在最壞情況下仍能滿足感知管線的截止時間。與國內車用電子廠商合作。",
            "en": "Schedules co-resident models on automotive SoCs and proves worst-case deadlines still hold for the perception pipeline. Works with an automotive electronics partner."
          },
          "email": "cwtang@example.edu.tw",
          "links": []
        },
        {
          "id": "yu-hsin-kuo",
          "name": { "zh": "郭宇昕", "en": "Yu-Hsin Kuo" },
          "role": { "zh": "博士班一年級", "en": "First-year PhD student" },
          "focus": [
            { "zh": "聯邦學習", "en": "Federated learning" },
            { "zh": "差分隱私", "en": "Differential privacy" },
            { "zh": "能耗量測", "en": "Energy measurement" }
          ],
          "work": {
            "zh": "量測裝置端訓練的真實能耗，並研究隱私預算與電池壽命之間的交換關係。碩士班同樣在本實驗室完成。",
            "en": "Measures what on-device training actually costs in battery terms, and studies the exchange rate between privacy budget and device lifetime. Did a master's here as well."
